From: MyszkinPL <211237936+MyszkinPL@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mfd: axp20x: reach the AXP803 through the Allwinner BSP BL31

On A64/R18 devices running the Allwinner BSP ATF together with the AR100
SCP firmware, the AXP803 sits on the R_RSB bus owned by the SCP and the OS
can reach it only through BL31 calls (0x8000ff12 read, 0x8000ff13 write).
Add an axp20x regmap over those calls, so the regulators are visible to
Linux. Writes are refused unless allow_writes is set, and even then only
the DLDO1/DLDO4 enable bits may change. axp803-atf-peek is a read-only
debugfs dump of the same registers.

Signed-off-by: MyszkinPL <211237936+MyszkinPL@users.noreply.github.com>
---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/allwinner,sun50i-a64-atf-axp803.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/allwinner,sun50i-a64-atf-axp803.yaml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f59bd62
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/allwinner,sun50i-a64-atf-axp803.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,50 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-2-Clause)
+%YAML 1.2
+---
+$id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/mfd/allwinner,sun50i-a64-atf-axp803.yaml#
+$schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
+
+title: X-Powers AXP803 PMIC behind the Allwinner BSP firmware
+
+maintainers:
+  - Chen-Yu Tsai <wens@csie.org>
+
+description: |
+  On A64/R18 devices that run the Allwinner BSP ARM Trusted Firmware
+  together with the AR100 (SCP) firmware, the AXP803 is attached to the
+  R_RSB bus owned by the SCP. The operating system reaches the PMIC only
+  through BL31 calls (0x8000ff12 read, 0x8000ff13 write), so the node sits
+  at the root of the tree instead of under the RSB controller, and has no
+  interrupt (the PMIC interrupt is handled by the SCP).
+
+  The regulators subnode follows x-powers,axp152.yaml.
+
+properties:
+  compatible:
+    const: allwinner,sun50i-a64-atf-axp803
+
+  regulators:
+    type: object
+    description: AXP803 regulators, as in x-powers,axp152.yaml.
+
+required:
+  - compatible
+
+additionalProperties: false
+
+examples:
+  - |
+    pmic {
+        compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-a64-atf-axp803";
+
+        regulators {
+            x-powers,dcdc-freq = <3000>;
+
+            dcdc1 {
+                regulator-name = "vcc-io";
+                regulator-always-on;
+                regulator-min-microvolt = <3300000>;
+                regulator-max-microvolt = <3300000>;
+            };
+        };
+    };
